{
  "id": "mineral_wool_insulation",
  "title": "Mineral Wool Insulation",
  "description": "Thermal conductivity - k-values - vs. temperature for mineral wool insulation made from molten glass, stone or slag.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Mineral Wool Insulation\n\nMineral wool is made from molten glass, stone or slag that is spun into a fiber-like structure. Inorganic rock or slag are the main components (typically **98%**) of stone wool. The remaining **2%** organic content is generally a thermosetting resin binder (an adhesive) and a little oil.\n\n## Temperature Conversion\n*T (°C) = 5/9 (T (°F) - 32)*"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_c",
          "label": "Temperature (°C)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "thickness",
          "label": "Insulation Thickness",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Density",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Low Density (20-40 kg/m³)",
              "value": 30
            },
            {
              "label": "Medium Density (40-80 kg/m³)",
              "value": 60
            },
            {
              "label": "High Density (80-150 kg/m³)",
              "value": 110
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 60,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_f",
          "label": "Temperature (°F)",
          "formula": "inputs.temperature_c * 9/5 + 32",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": "°F"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_value",
          "label": "Thermal Conductivity (k-value)",
          "formula": "0.032 + (inputs.temperature_c * 0.0001)",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": "W/m·K"
        },
        {
          "id": "r_value",
          "label": "Thermal Resistance (R-value)",
          "formula": "(inputs.thickness / 1000) / (0.032 + (inputs.temperature_c * 0.0001))",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": "m²·K/W"
        },
        {
          "id": "u_value",
          "label": "Heat Transfer Coefficient (U-value)",
          "formula": "1 / ((inputs.thickness / 1000) / (0.032 + (inputs.temperature_c * 0.0001)))",
          "format": "decimal",
          "unit": "W/m²·K"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Temperature (°C)",
        "Temperature (°F)",
        "Typical k-value (W/m·K)",
        "Density (kg/m³)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "-10",
          "14",
          "0.031",
          "30-150"
        ],
        [
